<title>CHILE: Telex-Chile Q1 net plummets.</title>
<headline>Telex-Chile Q1 net plummets.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean long distance telecommunications company Telex-Chile reported the following results for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>				 Q1 1997		   Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit		    133 million	     2.05 billion</p>
<p>Operating profit	    950 million	     2.43 billion</p>
<p>Non-operating loss	  785 million	  loss 42 million</p>
<p>Total revenues	    15.03 billion	   15.04 billion</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211))</p>
</text>
